<div class="passage-content">
What does the NHL Shield look like?

Reebok used two different shields. Earlier shields used a plain black and silver embroidered logo, and later designs used a felt-ish shield with a scalloped background design. Both are legitimate, but the plain embroidered shield is more commonly faked.

<small>Tap the image that matches your shield.</small>
